# Backend — Java + Spring Boot + Gradle (Kotlin DSL).
# Cross-cutting ignores (OS junk, .idea/.vscode, .env, *.log) live in the ROOT .gitignore.
# Keep only Java/Gradle-specific rules here.

# === Gradle ===
.gradle/
build/
# The Gradle wrapper jar MUST be committed so ./gradlew works on a fresh clone.
# (do not add a blanket "*.jar" here — it would swallow the wrapper)
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# === Java ===
*.class
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# === IntelliJ build output ===
# Anchored: IntelliJ writes out/ at the project root and out/production, out/test in each module.
# An unanchored out/ would also hide every hexagonal adapter/out/ and port/out/ source package.
/out/
**/out/production/
**/out/test/

# === Eclipse / Buildship build output (bin/main, bin/test — a copy of src/) ===
bin/
